#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2921
msgid "There are up to three possible options that can be selected:"
msgstr "Det går att välja upp till tre alternativ:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2923
msgid ""
"<quote><guilabel>Paired</guilabel></quote> versus "
"<quote><guilabel>Unpaired</guilabel></quote>"
msgstr ""
"<quote><guilabel>Parade</guilabel></quote> eller "
"<quote><guilabel>Oparade</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2924
msgid ""
"If the variables are dependent (or paired) select the "
"<quote><guilabel>Paired</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om variablerna är beroende av varandra (parade) väljer du alternativet "
"<quote><guilabel>Parade</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2929
msgid ""
"<quote><guilabel>Known</guilabel></quote> versus "
"<quote><guilabel>Unknown</guilabel></quote>"
msgstr ""
"<quote><guilabel>Kända</guilabel></quote> eller "
"<quote><guilabel>Okända</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2930
msgid ""
"For unpaired or independent variables, the population variances may be known"
" or unknown. In the latter case they will be estimated using the sample "
"variances. Select the <quote><guilabel>Known</guilabel></quote> option if "
"you in fact know the population variances prior to collecting the sample."
msgstr ""
"För oparade eller oberoende variabler kan populationsvarianserna vara kända "
"eller okända. I det senare fallet skattas de med stickprovsvarianserna. Välj"
" alternativet <quote><guilabel>Kända</guilabel></quote> om du faktiskt "
"känner till populationsvarianserna innan urvalet samlas in."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2937
msgid ""
"<quote><guilabel>Equal</guilabel></quote> versus "
"<quote><guilabel>Unequal</guilabel></quote>"
msgstr ""
"<quote><guilabel>Lika</guilabel></quote> eller "
"<quote><guilabel>Olika</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2938
msgid ""
"For paired variables with unknown population variances, we may either assume"
" that the population variances are equal or not. If the population variances"
" are assumed to be equal, <application>Gnumeric</application> will estimate "
"the common variance by pooling the sample variances. Select the "
"<quote><guilabel>Equal</guilabel></quote> option to assume that the "
"population variances are equal."
msgstr ""
"När populationsvarianserna för parade variabler är okända kan vi anta att de"
" är lika eller olika. Om de antas vara lika skattar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> den gemensamma variansen genom att slå "
"samman stickprovsvarianserna. Välj alternativet "
"<quote><guilabel>Lika</guilabel></quote> om du vill anta att "
"populationsvarianserna är lika."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2949
msgid "<parameter>t</parameter>-Test: Paired Two Sample for Means Tool"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>-test: verktyg för medelvärden i två parade urval"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2951
msgid "<parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Paired) Tool Dialog Options"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>-test: alternativ i dialogrutan för parade urval"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2953
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-paired.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the options"
" for the t-test.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-paired.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av alternativen"
" för t-testet.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2964
msgid ""
"For paired variables, when you click on "
"<quote><guibutton>OK</guibutton></quote>, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will test whether the mean of the "
"difference between the paired variables is equal to the given hypothesized "
"mean difference."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på <quote><guibutton>OK</guibutton></quote> testar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> om medelvärdet av skillnaderna mellan de"
" parade variablerna är lika med den angivna hypotetiska "
"medelvärdesskillnaden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2970
msgid "Using the <parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Paired) Tool"
msgstr "Använda verktyget för parad <parameter>t</parameter>-test"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2971
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"ttest-paired-tool-ex1\"/> for an example of a completed "
"dialog and <xref linkend=\"ttest-paired-tool-ex2\"/> for the corresponding "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"ttest-paired-tool-ex1\"/> för ett exempel på en ifylld "
"dialogruta och <xref linkend=\"ttest-paired-tool-ex2\"/> för motsvarande "
"resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2977
msgid "<parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Paired) Example Data"
msgstr "<parameter>t</parameter>-test (parat): exempeldata"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2979
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-paired-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the example for a t-test.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-paired-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"exemplet för ett t-test.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2991
msgid "Output from the <parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Paired) Tool"
msgstr "Resultat från verktyget för parad <parameter>t</parameter>-test"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2993
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-paired-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"the output results from a t-test.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-paired-"
"ex2.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"resultatet från ett t-test.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3008
msgid ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>-Test: Two-Sample Assuming Equal Variances Tool"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>-test: verktyg för två urval med lika varianser"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3010
msgid "<parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Equal Variances) Tool Dialog Options"
msgstr "<parameter>t</parameter>-test (lika varianser): dialogrutealternativ"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3013
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-equal.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the options"
" for a t-test analysis of two samples with equal variances.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-equal.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av alternativen"
" för ett t-test av två urval med lika varianser.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3025
msgid ""
"For unpaired variables with unknown but assumed equal population variances, "
"when you click on <quote><guibutton>OK</guibutton></quote>, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will test whether the mean of the "
"difference between the paired variables is equal to the given hypothesized "
"mean difference."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på <quote><guibutton>OK</guibutton></quote> testar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> om skillnaden mellan de oparade "
"variablernas medelvärden är lika med den angivna hypotetiska "
"medelvärdesskillnaden. Detta gäller när populationsvarianserna är okända men"
" antas vara lika."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3031
msgid ""
"Using the <parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Unknown but Equal Variances) Tool"
msgstr ""
"Använda verktyget för <parameter>t</parameter>-test med okända men antagna "
"lika varianser"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3032
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"ttest-equal-tool-ex1\"/> for an example of a completed "
"dialog and <xref linkend=\"ttest-equal-tool-ex2\"/> for the corresponding "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"ttest-equal-tool-ex1\"/> för ett exempel på en ifylld "
"dialogruta och <xref linkend=\"ttest-equal-tool-ex2\"/> för motsvarande "
"resultat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3038
msgid ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Unknown but Equal Variances) Example Data"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>t</parameter>-test (okända men antagna lika varianser): "
"exempeldata"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3040
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-equal-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of "
"example data for use with a t-test with unknown but equal "
"variances.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-ttest-equal-"
"ex1.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av "
"exempeldata för ett t-test med okända men lika varianser.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3053
msgid ""
"Output from the <parameter>t</parameter>-Test (Unknown but Equal Variances) "
"Tool"
msgstr ""
"Resultat från verktyget för <parameter>t</parameter>-test med okända men "
"antagna lika varianser"
